**/waveforms/
**/__pycache__/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
venv/
.venv/
env/

*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
*.out
*.tmp
*.swp
*.un~

# Keep large local model folders out unless intentionally added.
**/models/

